# Voice memo pipeline config — single source of truth for shared paths.
#
# Both sync-ic-recorder.sh (bash) and transcribe.py (Python) read this file.
# install.sh copies this to ~/.config/voicememo/config.sh on first install.
# Edit the live copy at ~/.config/voicememo/config.sh — not this template.

# Canonical recordings root. Subdirs derived: $SONY_BASE/Files (mp3s),
# $SONY_BASE/Memos (monthly .md transcripts). ~/Documents is iCloud-synced
# if you have Desktop & Documents Sync on, which gives you a free
# off-machine backup of recordings + transcripts.
SONY_BASE="$HOME/Documents/Sony"

# Per-mp3 cache (transcripts/ + processed/). Lives outside SONY_BASE by
# default because iCloud's bird daemon takes exclusive locks while syncing
# small files, which crashed the month-rebuild loop. Override only if you
# know your cache target is not iCloud-managed. See README "macOS gotchas".
# CACHE_BASE="$HOME/Library/Caches/voicememo"

# Vocabulary file (transcription prompt hint). Defaults to
# ~/.config/voicememo/vocabulary.md. Point this at your Obsidian/notes vault
# if you want to edit it alongside your other notes.
# VOCAB_FILE="$HOME/vaults/main/Memos/vocabulary.md"
